# site/ build artifacts: the site stage runs its own `npm ci` and
# `npm run build` inside the Linux container. Host-generated node_modules
# (built for the host's OS/arch, e.g. Windows) and stale .next/out caches
# must never enter the build context, or COPY site/ ./ would overwrite the
# container's freshly installed Linux packages with incompatible ones.
node_modules
.next
site/out
